 most revenue teams still solve with spreadsheets. She holds a degree in Computer Science and Mathematics.",[],"normal",{"alt":9,"altText":445,"asset":446,"bgColor":448,"caption":9,"dimensions":449,"lqip":451,"originalFilename":452},"Dena Omar, GTM engineer",{"_ref":447,"_type":13},"image-23040f40428f39e3252166c22e8cfa4cba4957b9-512x512-png","#cb9471",{"_type":16,"aspectRatio":17,"height":450,"width":450},512,"data:image\u002Fpng;base64,\u002F8NHseN+jUDpfPRHUHv\u002F+fh5Xh9WMtNea6XwhiYZmmgswOYQ\u002FnFt7pi8Etlus1qIBdZ19NfXo79\u002FWL1\u002FQzO1dLNIiOzU0OWdJu2WwnbBrxUG0hRWP8D7cFVQWapGEsXwxRd3yV+2w7++l37\u002FFqwHpWoWpUfdrSbudGl3DFc4SJfZj51tFACoRzIZL4dc33WJD0+9P7+k\u002FviG\u002FWp6W8Qj3UZ5JbNHeLfc1wZpEqvL7Eref0sXmXG3hYX8yQvruhL7ia39pg8+PA20VhoLeoppRJgNjaX4WhN3iwO8FBld3r9aVziJnTRKNz4n7Dr9tH5tf27jP4PGu2mpjvi9sAUL+We91kYFx7X38EJgNHF\u002Ftiaz83GXwGKw5dT06pOw7UTNB972k3QuFHRaYfMJcuWddhp7WD90pvKQKsyXB14V6FGnlUKiXpfTajoJwialHP56kKrFPc4zk91iwsJ+qt9aq\u002Fx\\u002Ff1ahrDcATLpTNJBPG63a5zS8QNF3GkXSmXboiQ3+exWYNuuJSKg0lnLc9XEg1Rw4fp4L55W9rfnEBv0hkkFnM57M4zU9x9XkDCNTJXIfOJaMQF21xWMxa8GLeKOpjoEg2N+q1ht1kp5tH4fm0imYqGQjar1X76WcRhzoZ8ZBItZIkUingcDthsinpsDwVcpXu6NIOGnUb\u002Fvl7MZZF4HEexNIZf+QMWs\u002Fn85NXV+Ql26UhFQykkgSfiXrcbtpyGXWfNTEQc32kC9Q9ZQmm2kt2YDwAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==","dena-omar.png","Dena Omar ","\u002Fauthor\u002Fdena-omar","GTM Engineer",[457],{"_id":458,"group":459,"slug":460,"title":463},"ddc42d4b-a841-4a67-983b-815680415015","blog-category",{"_type":461,"current":462},"slug","\u002Ftag\u002Fblog-category\u002Fconsolidation-and-scaling","Consolidation & Scaling",{"description":9,"image":9,"title":9},{"alt":9,"altText":466,"asset":467,"bgColor":469,"caption":9,"dimensions":470,"lqip":474,"originalFilename":475},"Abstract interlocking mark in a white circle on a yellow layered-square background",{"_ref":468,"_type":13},"image-e4a69abd0cab36b6a6db8f5b234d8cd9a5cb9d77-800x552-png","#fceca4",{"_type":16,"aspectRatio":471,"height":472,"width":473},1.4492753623188406,552,800,"d